Here's a quick start for building NetHack with Mingw32

( [] contains commands you type in at the command prompt)
  {gnudir} represents the location where you choose to install 
           the gnuwin32 utilities below.)

 1. Obtain and install latest mingw from:
    http://prdownloads.sf.net/mingw/MinGW-3.1.0-1.exe?download
 2. Download the NetHack sources.
    http://prdownloads.sf.net/nethack/nethack-342.tgz?download
 3. Unpack the NetHack sources. 
    Don't have a way to do that? Download and execute:
    http://prdownloads.sf.net/gnuwin32/gzip-1.3.5-bin.exe?download
    [{gnudir}\bin\gunzip nethack-342.tgz]
    Also download and execute:
    http://prdownloads.sf.net/gnuwin32/tar-1.13-1-bin.exe?download
    [{gnudir}\bin\tar -xvf nethack-342.tar]
 4. Go to the top of the NetHack source tree you just unpacked.
 5. [cd sys\winnt]
 6. [nhsetup.bat]
 7. [cd ..\..\src]
 8. [mingw32-make -f Makefile.gcc install]
    ...much activity...
 9. [cd ..\binary]
10. [nethack]
